  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-8adb37de.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice red onion into wedges.\n• Cut cauliflower (including the stalk!) into small florets.\n• Roughly chop walnuts. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-eb02d5c6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place snacking tomatoes, onion and cauliflower on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl combine plant-based pesto and plant-based mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-4592a9e9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a medium saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock powder. Bring to the boil, then simmer, uncovered, until couscous tender and water is absorbed, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-693df23f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the couscous is ready, add roasted tomatoes, cauliflower, onion and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar to the pan.\n• Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-3a2cde85.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie pearl couscous between bowls. Top with garlicky roast pumpkin. Dollop with plant-based mayo.\n• Drizzle with plant-based basil pesto and sprinkle with chopped walnuts. Crumble over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c526b8c7d7f8f46885c6e8-88ddf1c2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
